Readout of Ambassador Mike Waltz’s Meeting with Deputy Prime Minister and Foreign Minister Ayman Safadi
The below is attributable to a U.S. Mission to the United Nations spokesperson:
Ambassador Mike Waltz, Representative of the United States to the United Nations, met with Deputy Prime Minister and Foreign Minister Ayman Safadi, on December 7, 2025, and discussed the importance of the President’s Comprehensive Plan to End the Gaza Conflict and UN Security Council Resolution 2803, as well the urgency to train vetted Palestinian police.
They discussed regional issues, including Syria, and Jordan’s important role and close cooperation with the United States.
