Readout of Ambassador Mike Waltz’s Meeting with His Royal Highness Crown Prince Al Hussein bin Abdullah II of Jordan
The below is attributable to a U.S. Mission to the United Nations spokesperson:
Ambassador Mike Waltz, Representative of the United States to the United Nations, met with His Royal Highness Crown Prince Al Hussein bin Abdullah II of Jordan, on December 7, 2025. Ambassador Waltz and the Crown Prince discussed the importance of implementing the President’s Comprehensive Plan to End the Gaza Conflict, especially its provisions on humanitarian aid for Palestinian civilians in Gaza. They also discussed the pivotal role Jordan is playing and will continue to play in the India-Middle East-Europe Economic Corridor (IMEC).
Ambassador Waltz emphasized continued U.S. support for peace, stability, and prosperity in the region.
